# Protocol Provisions for Agreement Entry into Force and Termination

```catala
declaration scope AgreementDates:
  input date_three_parties content date
  input date_accession_deposit content date
  input date_denunciation_receipt content date
  output date_entry_into_force content date
  output date_accession_effect content date
  output date_denunciation_effect content date
```

## Agreement Entry into Force

This agreement enters into force one month after the date on which three Member States become Parties.

```catala
scope AgreementDates:
  definition date_entry_into_force equals date_three_parties + 1 month
```

## Accession Effect

An instrument of accession takes effect one month after the date of its deposit.

```catala
scope AgreementDates:
  definition date_accession_effect equals date_accession_deposit + 1 month
```

## Denunciation Effect

Denunciation takes effect six months after the date of receipt of the notification.

```catala
scope AgreementDates:
  definition date_denunciation_effect equals date_denunciation_receipt + 6 month
```